        "claim": "Children with SEN support are over four times more likely to be excluded than those without SEN.",
        "evidence_id": "E5",
        "quote": "Children with SEN support are over four times more likely to be excluded than those without SEN"
      },
      {
        "tier": "measurable",
        "claim": "Nearly two-thirds of permanently excluded pupils were eligible for Free School Meals, with their exclusion rate far higher than non-FSM pupils.",
        "evidence_id": "E4",
        "quote": "Nearly two-thirds of permanently excluded pupils were eligible for Free School Meals (FSM), and their permanent exclusion rate (0.33%) is significantly higher than for non-FSM pupils (0.06%)"
      },
      {
